title Spike 17: the command grid
about BAR's layout: the build grid (items on QWER ASDF, tabs on ZXCV) over the info pane, the orders grid beside them, resources at the top, the team bottom right. What blue.0 would see as it selects builders, a factory, a mixed group, one unit, an army.

scenario economy
players blue 2
clip 0..2250
speed 3
camera 90,256 150

at 30 select blue engineer as crew
at 31 show crew                     # builders: the economy tab
at 330 show crew tab 3              # ... the build tab
at 600 select blue factory as plant
at 601 show plant                   # a factory: the army page, what's queued
at 900 show plant tab 1             # ... logistics: the trucks
at 1200 select blue any within 40 of 74,256 as near
at 1201 show near                   # a mixed group: a tile per type
at 1500 select blue factory max 1 as one
at 1501 show one                    # one unit: its details, its queue
at 1800 select blue raider as army
at 1801 show army                   # combat units: their orders (move, fight, stop, entrench)

at 1200 expect near alive >= 3
at 1500 expect one alive == 1
at 1800 expect army alive >= 1
